  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.21 Property tax deferral",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.21 “Property tax deferral” means a postponement of the payment of all or part of the property taxes due on a person’s homestead. The term includes “tax deferral for elderly and disabled” pursuant to RSA 72:38-a.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.20)",
